stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Review : submit
    Review --> WaitingForEvidence:::waiting : missing evidence
    WaitingForEvidence --> Review : evidence added
    Review --> Approved:::good : approve
    Review --> Rejected:::bad : reject
    Approved --> InEffect : schedule
    InEffect --> Validating : complete work
    Validating --> Closed:::good : pass checks
    Validating --> Revoking:::bad : fail checks
    Revoking --> Closed : restore baseline
    Rejected --> [*]
    Closed --> [*]
    classDef good fill:#14532d,stroke:#22c55e
    classDef bad fill:#7f1d1d,stroke:#ef4444
    classDef waiting fill:#c2410c,stroke:#f97316
